DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-27T09:57:17&endDate=2026-09-28T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nCentral Line: No service between Liverpool Street and Woodford / Newbury Park due to planned engineering work. SEVERE DELAYS between White City and West Ruislip. MINOR DELAYS between White City and Ealing Broadway due to earlier faulty trains at Liverpool Street. Tickets are being accepted on London Buses\, Elizabeth line and Chiltern Railway. GOOD SERVICE on the rest of the line.  
